                                "sense_id": "ef7388f9-6aaa-3f3a-b480-c214def33d87",
                                "text": "“Kłodzko Land,” as the basin is also called, forms a rectangular jut into Czechia that is sealed at its southwestern back by a fifty-kilometer-long ridge known as the Orlické (Eagle) Mountains […]"
                            }
